(257467, 17518, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and shadows here that tell me that pi is someting complex that is created out of something simple: a circle. Seems slightly out of focus, but I find this image engaging.</td>', 'Interesting lines and shadows here that tell me that pi is someting complex that is created out of something simple: a circle. Seems slightly out of focus, but I find this image engaging.', '2003-04-07 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
