(257478, 17283, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts between pi and the white stripes of the bullseye here. I am confused, however, at what I''m supposed to "see" here. It seems symbolic of some kind of "pi essence," but I can''t make that connection. It is a tad out of focus, but it is also an image I like and will return to in order to discover its secrets.</td>', 'I like the contrasts between pi and the white stripes of the bullseye here. I am confused, however, at what I''m supposed to "see" here. It seems symbolic of some kind of "pi essence," but I can''t make that connection. It is a tad out of focus, but it is also an image I like and will return to in order to discover its secrets.', '2003-04-07 19:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(257480, 17387, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, was great in symmetry also.......good work good job.....good color, light. Bravo.</td>', 'Yes, was great in symmetry also.......good work good job.....good color, light. Bravo.', '2003-04-07 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
