(257496, 17194, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes she is...bery beautiful portrait..love the focus, lens, light, tones.</td>', 'Yes she is...bery beautiful portrait..love the focus, lens, light, tones.', '2003-04-07 19:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(257499, 17427, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, tones, and light. Good composition. Nice nice work.</td>', 'Nice focus, tones, and light. Good composition. Nice nice work.', '2003-04-07 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(257501, 16842, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, I can vaguely see pi here with the curved roof and vertical sides of the building. I think? I like this concept, and I like lines you''ve created with your perspective and good cropping. It seems that in such a context, pi can be seen as an essential element in architecture; you are showing its usefulness by also showing us its shape on/as the building? Perhaps to be more effective, if that is your aim, some unique lighting would be appropriate, perhaps in a less harsh time of the day (in terms of light). This would bring out pi''s mythic ability to be applied to almost anything and would transport your image from being a picture of a building that looks like pi to an image that suggests that pi is everywhere and is a pervasive force to be reckoned with.</td>', 'Okay, I can vaguely see pi here with the curved roof and vertical sides of the building. I think? I like this concept, and I like lines you''ve created with your perspective and good cropping. It seems that in such a context, pi can be seen as an essential element in architecture; you are showing its usefulness by also showing us its shape on/as the building? Perhaps to be more effective, if that is your aim, some unique lighting would be appropriate, perhaps in a less harsh time of the day (in terms of light). This would bring out pi''s mythic ability to be applied to almost anything and would transport your image from being a picture of a building that looks like pi to an image that suggests that pi is everywhere and is a pervasive force to be reckoned with.', '2003-04-07 19:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(257507, 17562, 327, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot..love the dof, blue, light. Nice.</td>', 'I really like this shot..love the dof, blue, light. Nice.', '2003-04-07 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(257512, 17295, 327, '<td valign="top">Great looking shot....love the tones here, and the texture of stone, siding. Cool shot.</td>', 'Great looking shot....love the tones here, and the texture of stone, siding. Cool shot.', '2003-04-07 19:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(257513, 17419, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is a pie, and not really pi, but the lines you use with chocolate do suggest pi, as pi deals directly with the diameter of a circle. While the image is out of focus, I do think the lines and textures help create interest.</td>', 'Okay, this is a pie, and not really pi, but the lines you use with chocolate do suggest pi, as pi deals directly with the diameter of a circle. While the image is out of focus, I do think the lines and textures help create interest.', '2003-04-07 19:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
