(257576, 17595, 6328, '<td valign="top">Neat idea for the Pi Challenge, shows some imagination on your part. photograph seems kind of grainy though, good color off the steps, shows some good rust spots off the steel bottom rails, visual impact is not all that stunning, but is acceptable enough for the Challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea for the Pi Challenge, shows some imagination on your part. photograph seems kind of grainy though, good color off the steps, shows some good rust spots off the steel bottom rails, visual impact is not all that stunning, but is acceptable enough for the Challenge.', '2003-04-07 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(257578, 16842, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice colours, good reflections, ideal lighting for daylight.</td>', 'nice colours, good reflections, ideal lighting for daylight.', '2003-04-07 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(257579, 17562, 6328, '<td valign="top">Great idea for Pi, shows some imagination from you.  good focus, nice colors, impressive looking dirt.</td>', 'Great idea for Pi, shows some imagination from you.  good focus, nice colors, impressive looking dirt.', '2003-04-07 20:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(257581, 17396, 4536, '<td valign="top">Good representation, could be used for a pie advertisement :). Is that the lid of a neg. developing can?</td>', 'Good representation, could be used for a pie advertisement :). Is that the lid of a neg. developing can?', '2003-04-07 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(257585, 17540, 4536, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. I don''t understand the framing though, it is quite awkward the way it''s uneven.</td>', 'Clever idea. I don''t understand the framing though, it is quite awkward the way it''s uneven.', '2003-04-07 20:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(257587, 17483, 6328, '<td valign="top">Impressive idea for a Pi Challenge.  Do tell us how you did this will you?  Visual impact is stimulating to say the least. Focus is excellent in my opinion. Absolutely splendid black and white photography.</td>', 'Impressive idea for a Pi Challenge.  Do tell us how you did this will you?  Visual impact is stimulating to say the least. Focus is excellent in my opinion. Absolutely splendid black and white photography.', '2003-04-07 20:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(257591, 17287, 6521, '<td valign="top">very cool photo but to bright above the eye. But very nice...</td>', 'very cool photo but to bright above the eye. But very nice...', '2003-04-07 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(257594, 17406, 6521, '<td valign="top">brilliant!</td>', 'brilliant!', '2003-04-07 20:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(257597, 16783, 6521, '<td valign="top">great photo!</td>', 'great photo!', '2003-04-07 20:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(257604, 16917, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good colors on the pumpkin, nice lighting, good idea for the Pi Challenge, but you''ve got the formula wrong, it''s 3.1415926535etc</td>', 'Nice photo, good colors on the pumpkin, nice lighting, good idea for the Pi Challenge, but you''ve got the formula wrong, it''s 3.1415926535etc', '2003-04-07 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(257620, 17427, 6328, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful and outstanding black and white photograph.   Excellent focus with such sharpness. Lighting is great.  The visual impact of your photograph is exceptional.  Your work shows great inspiration and creativeness.</td>', 'Another beautiful and outstanding black and white photograph.   Excellent focus with such sharpness. Lighting is great.  The visual impact of your photograph is exceptional.  Your work shows great inspiration and creativeness.', '2003-04-07 20:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(257623, 16967, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors, good lighting, good choice of background too. focus seems right on. . .</td>', 'Really nice colors, good lighting, good choice of background too. focus seems right on. . .', '2003-04-07 20:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(257627, 17317, 6328, '<td valign="top">very nice choice for the Pi Challenge, very natural too.  Is that a coat hanger?  shows some good color, nice lighting.</td>', 'very nice choice for the Pi Challenge, very natural too.  Is that a coat hanger?  shows some good color, nice lighting.', '2003-04-07 20:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(257632, 17191, 6328, '<td valign="top">A real natural for Pi?  Shows some good color, good lighting, focus is just fine too. A good idea for the Challenge.</td>', 'A real natural for Pi?  Shows some good color, good lighting, focus is just fine too. A good idea for the Challenge.', '2003-04-07 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(257636, 17092, 6328, '<td valign="top">Cherry Pi''d 2!  Nice colour, good focus, good lighting too!  Nice R square Pi, wonder how it tastes??  Nice overall photo.</td>', 'Cherry Pi''d 2!  Nice colour, good focus, good lighting too!  Nice R square Pi, wonder how it tastes??  Nice overall photo.', '2003-04-07 20:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(257640, 17528, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, good lighting, but leaves a bit of shadow, good framing colours too, nice sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice colours, good lighting, but leaves a bit of shadow, good framing colours too, nice sharp focus.', '2003-04-07 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(257643, 17288, 6328, '<td valign="top">I certainly see your flash reflecting off the whatchamacallit and the sideways glass.  good shot of the Pi on top of the clock.  nice colors off to the side too</td>', 'I certainly see your flash reflecting off the whatchamacallit and the sideways glass.  good shot of the Pi on top of the clock.  nice colors off to the side too', '2003-04-07 20:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(257647, 17382, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the Pi neapple!  good shadow from the lighting too.  good use of 3rds here, nice colors too.</td>', 'Nice shot of the Pi neapple!  good shadow from the lighting too.  good use of 3rds here, nice colors too.', '2003-04-07 20:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(257651, 17540, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice apple Pi.  good red colors from those apples.  Good idea that you came up with, but how come you couldn''t get the top and sides straight?</td>', 'nice apple Pi.  good red colors from those apples.  Good idea that you came up with, but how come you couldn''t get the top and sides straight?', '2003-04-07 20:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
