(257667, 17310, 6328, '<td valign="top">This is quite different, but it''s all Greek to me - so just pass the Pi on if you don''t mind!  Nice color and lighting, good dof, focusing is just fine, nice work.</td>', 'This is quite different, but it''s all Greek to me - so just pass the Pi on if you don''t mind!  Nice color and lighting, good dof, focusing is just fine, nice work.', '2003-04-07 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(257676, 17374, 6328, '<td valign="top">This is really unusual.  Quite a design.  Nice color in the background.  Good lighting.  Too bad you couldn''t have come up with an idea of having it up there without holding it up with your hand - you would have come up with some really high points.</td>', 'This is really unusual.  Quite a design.  Nice color in the background.  Good lighting.  Too bad you couldn''t have come up with an idea of having it up there without holding it up with your hand - you would have come up with some really high points.', '2003-04-07 20:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
