(257937, 17387, 5266, '<td valign="top">Hey Budweezer - good job again!!  As I''ve already said - liked the lighting better last week, but the signposts are perfect for this challenge and the fluffy clouds are wonderful.</td>', 'Hey Budweezer - good job again!!  As I''ve already said - liked the lighting better last week, but the signposts are perfect for this challenge and the fluffy clouds are wonderful.', '2003-04-07 23:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
