(259873, 17419, 1135, '<td valign="top">Something about this photo just doesn''t look right; maybe it''s the white balance? Sharper focus would help too. Still, it looks good enough to eat!</td>', 'Something about this photo just doesn''t look right; maybe it''s the white balance? Sharper focus would help too. Still, it looks good enough to eat!', '2003-04-09 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
