(260123, 17225, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, detail, DOF and background.  Hard to say anything critical...okay, I don''t like borders.  (C:</td>', 'Excellent composition, detail, DOF and background.  Hard to say anything critical...okay, I don''t like borders.  (C:', '2003-04-09 04:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260128, 17388, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the pi logo on the card, and meets the challenge with the degree chart.  It has a bit of noise on the top of the card from the lighting and then loses the detail at the bottom of the card.  Little dust specks on the background</td>', 'I like the pi logo on the card, and meets the challenge with the degree chart.  It has a bit of noise on the top of the card from the lighting and then loses the detail at the bottom of the card.  Little dust specks on the background', '2003-04-09 04:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(260131, 17288, 6771, '<td valign="top">All those pi references.  good collection.  the lighting seems a bit off, and it makes the photo seem dulled down.  A bit more DOF would help get the clocks numbers more in focus, but then again it may be from downsizing the picture.</td>', 'All those pi references.  good collection.  the lighting seems a bit off, and it makes the photo seem dulled down.  A bit more DOF would help get the clocks numbers more in focus, but then again it may be from downsizing the picture.', '2003-04-09 04:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(260133, 17595, 6771, '<td valign="top">good reference.  probably seen those and never made the connection.  good eye.  There seems to be a lot of noise through the top half of the picture.  Did the flash fire?  If it did it must not of covered very well in that upper half.</td>', 'good reference.  probably seen those and never made the connection.  good eye.  There seems to be a lot of noise through the top half of the picture.  Did the flash fire?  If it did it must not of covered very well in that upper half.', '2003-04-09 04:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260145, 17512, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice one, very original! I like the shadow of the pi "sculpture" in the background. I might have used something different to the carpet though.</td>', 'Nice one, very original! I like the shadow of the pi "sculpture" in the background. I might have used something different to the carpet though.', '2003-04-09 05:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
