(260161, 17483, 7067, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame you can''t see the pi symbol in the biggest water drop of them all, the one cut off at the very top.</td>', 'It''s a shame you can''t see the pi symbol in the biggest water drop of them all, the one cut off at the very top.', '2003-04-09 05:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
