(261283, 16967, 6771, '<td valign="top">I am going to say that the lighting is a bit bright.  It is washing a little of the detail out of the skin and the flesh of the grapefruit.  I would have centered it in the frame/crop, since it is a lone subject</td>', 'I am going to say that the lighting is a bit bright.  It is washing a little of the detail out of the skin and the flesh of the grapefruit.  I would have centered it in the frame/crop, since it is a lone subject', '2003-04-10 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(261285, 17528, 6771, '<td valign="top">Appears to have good DOF, but the light seems to wash out all detail on the Pi sign.  Not sure if that is intentional to make it appear to glow or not.  I like the way it blurs the farther up it goes.  The frame is good in color, but I am not a fan of them.  Not that I deduct for it.</td>', 'Appears to have good DOF, but the light seems to wash out all detail on the Pi sign.  Not sure if that is intentional to make it appear to glow or not.  I like the way it blurs the farther up it goes.  The frame is good in color, but I am not a fan of them.  Not that I deduct for it.', '2003-04-10 00:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(261289, 17147, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea!  Never thought of that one.  Would like to see it a bit sharper.  Little dust spots or something all over.  How would this look in high key?</td>', 'Excellent idea!  Never thought of that one.  Would like to see it a bit sharper.  Little dust spots or something all over.  How would this look in high key?', '2003-04-10 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(261291, 16842, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice eye to see the pi.  The sky is blown out, but not surprised if that is the only angle to get it at.  The silver area seems a bit bright too.  How would this look in black and white?  and making it more "contrasty," or high key?</td>', 'Nice eye to see the pi.  The sky is blown out, but not surprised if that is the only angle to get it at.  The silver area seems a bit bright too.  How would this look in black and white?  and making it more "contrasty," or high key?', '2003-04-10 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261292, 17070, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very good idea.  A bit on the bright side, but the colors look great.  I would like to see it a bit sharper and cropped down some.  Maybe tilted up on the right side some?</td>', 'Very good idea.  A bit on the bright side, but the colors look great.  I would like to see it a bit sharper and cropped down some.  Maybe tilted up on the right side some?', '2003-04-10 00:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(261294, 17539, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very original.  decent focus, but maybe a touch more DOF to detail the 0.1415 guys.  I would like to see just a hint of light on the darker side to...just a touch.</td>', 'Very original.  decent focus, but maybe a touch more DOF to detail the 0.1415 guys.  I would like to see just a hint of light on the darker side to...just a touch.', '2003-04-10 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(261304, 16783, 7807, '<td valign="top">I think your graphic representation of the actual number of Psi which goes on for infinity is an acurate depiction of what it actually is.  I love the floatiness of the numbers coming from the inner resesses of the human brain, naturally existing prior to man''s discovery of it, only hinted of it''s existance by shapes seen by the eye.</td>', 'I think your graphic representation of the actual number of Psi which goes on for infinity is an acurate depiction of what it actually is.  I love the floatiness of the numbers coming from the inner resesses of the human brain, naturally existing prior to man''s discovery of it, only hinted of it''s existance by shapes seen by the eye.', '2003-04-10 00:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(261314, 17595, 4430, '<td valign="top">you gotta good eye for pi.</td>', 'you gotta good eye for pi.', '2003-04-10 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(261335, 17343, 4430, '<td valign="top">too bad for the powerlines.  Good eye, nice take on the challenge.  I like how the sun is hiding behind.</td>', 'too bad for the powerlines.  Good eye, nice take on the challenge.  I like how the sun is hiding behind.', '2003-04-10 01:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(261338, 17497, 4430, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this, and your dof.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this, and your dof.', '2003-04-10 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(261410, 17483, 259, '<td valign="top">couldn''t you do something to not make the bubbles change the pi''s into u''s.  jk bort.</td>', 'couldn''t you do something to not make the bubbles change the pi''s into u''s.  jk bort.', '2003-04-10 04:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(261421, 17427, 772, '<td valign="top">great photograph.... I think this is my favorite in this challenge.  I love the sharp detail and the diagonal composition... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'great photograph.... I think this is my favorite in this challenge.  I love the sharp detail and the diagonal composition... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-10 06:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(261423, 17264, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photo.. I think it woudl be stronger with the background having more sky and less ground, which would highlight your ''pi'' symbol with a lot more strength.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'I like the idea of this photo.. I think it woudl be stronger with the background having more sky and less ground, which would highlight your ''pi'' symbol with a lot more strength.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-10 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(261425, 17287, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot :)  = 10 - setzler</td>', 'great shot :)  = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-10 06:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(261707, 17287, 7175, '<td valign="top">If this photot doesnt win, I''ll be SHOCKED.. I cant understand how you did this without editing (Im assuming a directlight with a Pi shaped filter/blockout on it), but regardless, congrats on a GREAT shot!</td>', 'If this photot doesnt win, I''ll be SHOCKED.. I cant understand how you did this without editing (Im assuming a directlight with a Pi shaped filter/blockout on it), but regardless, congrats on a GREAT shot!', '2003-04-10 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261739, 16967, 2302, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this rotated more so the inside of the fruit was showing. The glare on the side of the grapefruit is a bit distracting and I think rotating the view would help that. I am not sure that the piece on the bottom serves much purpose here - I think I would try it without that added.</td>', 'I would like to have seen this rotated more so the inside of the fruit was showing. The glare on the side of the grapefruit is a bit distracting and I think rotating the view would help that. I am not sure that the piece on the bottom serves much purpose here - I think I would try it without that added.', '2003-04-10 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(261789, 16917, 6019, '<td valign="top">Very clever... I love the lighting and colour too!  Well done..</td>', 'Very clever... I love the lighting and colour too!  Well done..', '2003-04-10 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(261790, 17287, 6019, '<td valign="top">wow, HOW? did you do it... fantastic!</td>', 'wow, HOW? did you do it... fantastic!', '2003-04-10 17:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(261792, 17518, 6019, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely clever photo, well done!</td>', 'This is an extremely clever photo, well done!', '2003-04-10 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(261796, 17406, 6019, '<td valign="top">This is very clever and the lighting is great as is the depth of field , thank you for such a good idea!!</td>', 'This is very clever and the lighting is great as is the depth of field , thank you for such a good idea!!', '2003-04-10 17:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(261799, 17052, 6019, '<td valign="top">how unusual, well spotted!!</td>', 'how unusual, well spotted!!', '2003-04-10 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(261960, 17287, 6505, '<td valign="top">You really got me fool, cause i can''t see how this is possible... unless you have a contact with a pi on it.  Very cool shot though.</td>', 'You really got me fool, cause i can''t see how this is possible... unless you have a contact with a pi on it.  Very cool shot though.', '2003-04-10 21:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(261973, 17512, 6523, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  How did you get this to stand up?  It looks like you glued the cross-bar to the other two knives, but did you tape the supports to the carpet?<br/> <br/>Definitely cool.</td>', 'Very creative!  How did you get this to stand up?  It looks like you glued the cross-bar to the other two knives, but did you tape the supports to the carpet? Definitely cool.', '2003-04-10 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(261975, 17406, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like the use of sepia in this picture and the careful design of the ribbon on the background -- it conveys Pi very nicely!</td>', 'I like the use of sepia in this picture and the careful design of the ribbon on the background -- it conveys Pi very nicely!', '2003-04-10 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(261978, 17343, 6523, '<td valign="top">Good angle for the shot -- it''s a shame the power lines were there and you can''t spot edit them out, but you did a good job of getting them parallel to the crossbar and integrating them into the picture.</td>', 'Good angle for the shot -- it''s a shame the power lines were there and you can''t spot edit them out, but you did a good job of getting them parallel to the crossbar and integrating them into the picture.', '2003-04-10 21:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(261983, 17592, 6523, '<td valign="top">I tried to do this same picture -- I cut out a tortilla into the pi shape and then put the toppings on it, and it didn''t work at all as a photo (though it tasted good).  It looks like you did the opposite -- make the pizza and then cut it out.  Very nicely, I might add -- it makes a very appetizing-looking pi on that background!</td>', 'I tried to do this same picture -- I cut out a tortilla into the pi shape and then put the toppings on it, and it didn''t work at all as a photo (though it tasted good).  It looks like you did the opposite -- make the pizza and then cut it out.  Very nicely, I might add -- it makes a very appetizing-looking pi on that background!', '2003-04-10 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(261984, 17287, 6523, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo!</td>', 'A really nice photo!', '2003-04-10 22:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(261985, 17061, 6523, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little soft, but the colors work very nicely in the photo, and it definitely conveys the idea of pi.</td>', 'The focus is a little soft, but the colors work very nicely in the photo, and it definitely conveys the idea of pi.', '2003-04-10 22:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(261987, 17503, 6523, '<td valign="top">The picture is nice and sharp, and I like the way you convey pi.  For me, the photo would be more balanced if the whole legal pad was in the picture (I''m not sure why you cut off the lower right corner).  I would like to see the same photo without the ruler next to the pad, and without the brown frame -- somehow it seems to that it could be a stronger photo without those elements.</td>', 'The picture is nice and sharp, and I like the way you convey pi.  For me, the photo would be more balanced if the whole legal pad was in the picture (I''m not sure why you cut off the lower right corner).  I would like to see the same photo without the ruler next to the pad, and without the brown frame -- somehow it seems to that it could be a stronger photo without those elements.', '2003-04-10 22:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(261988, 17378, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love the idea for this -- it''s a little bright, which makes the numbers hard for me to see, but it really conveys the idea of pi.</td>', 'I love the idea for this -- it''s a little bright, which makes the numbers hard for me to see, but it really conveys the idea of pi.', '2003-04-10 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(261991, 17572, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of this photo, but it is so blurred that I can''t really tell what you''ve taken the picture of.</td>', 'I like the colors of this photo, but it is so blurred that I can''t really tell what you''ve taken the picture of.', '2003-04-10 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(261992, 17147, 6523, '<td valign="top">Clever!  I like the idea of combining pi with time -- definitely gives you a sense of the infinite.</td>', 'Clever!  I like the idea of combining pi with time -- definitely gives you a sense of the infinite.', '2003-04-10 22:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(261993, 17317, 6523, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo, though I think it becomes a bit stronger if you crop out that angled part of the branch at the top.</td>', 'I really love this photo, though I think it becomes a bit stronger if you crop out that angled part of the branch at the top.', '2003-04-10 22:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(261995, 17497, 6523, '<td valign="top">I really like the sense of movement you got in this photo.</td>', 'I really like the sense of movement you got in this photo.', '2003-04-10 22:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(262019, 17110, 6505, '<td valign="top">Picture is nice and the pie is great!</td>', 'Picture is nice and the pie is great!', '2003-04-10 23:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(262081, 17494, 6600, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of the ''crop'' job.....was 3.14 on a nearby screen?  Good job!</td>', 'I am not fond of the ''crop'' job.....was 3.14 on a nearby screen?  Good job!', '2003-04-11 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262131, 17317, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, wow, that IS a natural pi. I like this shot. The DOF is great and really sets the icy branchlet off  nicely.</td>', 'Hey, wow, that IS a natural pi. I like this shot. The DOF is great and really sets the icy branchlet off  nicely.', '2003-04-11 01:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(262134, 17491, 6870, '<td valign="top">I have to admit to being a bit confused at this one, but I can see pi at work anyway, and I really like the composition, focus and lighting of this image. It would go well in an outdoor magazine!</td>', 'I have to admit to being a bit confused at this one, but I can see pi at work anyway, and I really like the composition, focus and lighting of this image. It would go well in an outdoor magazine!', '2003-04-11 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(262139, 17566, 6870, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and interesting. I like the shadows a lot, and the colors are wonderful here. I think I''d like a little more information, though, like what the  objects are and if they have a relationship to pi at all.</td>', 'Mysterious and interesting. I like the shadows a lot, and the colors are wonderful here. I think I''d like a little more information, though, like what the  objects are and if they have a relationship to pi at all.', '2003-04-11 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(262142, 17256, 6870, '<td valign="top">You quiz my geometry skills here perhaps? I like how the inner circle is framed by the outer circle here. The creative focus is really intriquing and tends to imply that pi requires exactitude.</td>', 'You quiz my geometry skills here perhaps? I like how the inner circle is framed by the outer circle here. The creative focus is really intriquing and tends to imply that pi requires exactitude.', '2003-04-11 01:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(262148, 17199, 6870, '<td valign="top">I have to admit to being both intrigued and confused at this image. Of course it is a literal communication of pi is, but I find the basket and toothpicks really interesting in relation to the cold numbers. You''ve also used the non-scientific color of red as a background, so my mind is every which way. Hmmm. That could be a good thing!</td>', 'I have to admit to being both intrigued and confused at this image. Of course it is a literal communication of pi is, but I find the basket and toothpicks really interesting in relation to the cold numbers. You''ve also used the non-scientific color of red as a background, so my mind is every which way. Hmmm. That could be a good thing!', '2003-04-11 01:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(262153, 17483, 6870, '<td valign="top">I hate to admit it, but I''m getting a bit tired of seeing droplets of water refracting an image behind. However, I will not vote you down for it, because it works and it''s often a good idea. In this case, the droplets kind of deconstruct pi, dissecting it into pieces that are no less intriguing than the whole of pi, so this water droplet technique really works here, probably better than in other situations because the droplets actually can mean something and aren''t just a gimmick. Whew! Thanks for listening! And nice work.</td>', 'I hate to admit it, but I''m getting a bit tired of seeing droplets of water refracting an image behind. However, I will not vote you down for it, because it works and it''s often a good idea. In this case, the droplets kind of deconstruct pi, dissecting it into pieces that are no less intriguing than the whole of pi, so this water droplet technique really works here, probably better than in other situations because the droplets actually can mean something and aren''t just a gimmick. Whew! Thanks for listening! And nice work.', '2003-04-11 01:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(262159, 17399, 6870, '<td valign="top">What works so well for me here is that the fingers are being used as kind of a proxy radius for the drawn circle, so it really is the hand of pi. Nice work! The ring distracts me a bit, as I can''t see a clear connection to pi (though there is a connection to the finger!). The illumated pi on the back of the hand is a nice touch; I like how it is over exposed, giving it an unearthly feel. The image as a whole confuses me only slightly, since the image doesn''t really convince me that a hand is the best communication of pi, though it seems to be a natural one. Does that make sense? Anyway, very  nice work. High marks from me.</td>', 'What works so well for me here is that the fingers are being used as kind of a proxy radius for the drawn circle, so it really is the hand of pi. Nice work! The ring distracts me a bit, as I can''t see a clear connection to pi (though there is a connection to the finger!). The illumated pi on the back of the hand is a nice touch; I like how it is over exposed, giving it an unearthly feel. The image as a whole confuses me only slightly, since the image doesn''t really convince me that a hand is the best communication of pi, though it seems to be a natural one. Does that make sense? Anyway, very  nice work. High marks from me.', '2003-04-11 01:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(262167, 17542, 6870, '<td valign="top">I suppose you must be careful here, since you may be in violation of copyright law. It may also be against the rules as we''re not supposed to take photos of other people''s artwork, unless you add  your own artistic interpretation to it, which you arguably have done here. I''m glad you added the DVD with the pi symbol on it--that helps this image and adds a nice balance to the whole. Juxtaposing the numbers with the void and larger pi sign works well. This image is difficult to critique because I''m not sure what is your work and what is the work of the graphic artist who came up with the film poster. Well, I hope that helps.</td>', 'I suppose you must be careful here, since you may be in violation of copyright law. It may also be against the rules as we''re not supposed to take photos of other people''s artwork, unless you add  your own artistic interpretation to it, which you arguably have done here. I''m glad you added the DVD with the pi symbol on it--that helps this image and adds a nice balance to the whole. Juxtaposing the numbers with the void and larger pi sign works well. This image is difficult to critique because I''m not sure what is your work and what is the work of the graphic artist who came up with the film poster. Well, I hope that helps.', '2003-04-11 01:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(262173, 17388, 6870, '<td valign="top">When I see this image, I see circles, radii, and a storage disk. The lighting is fairly straightforward, not much mystery or anything, and the composition is almost symmetrical. And now I don''t know what to do with these pieces I just described. I''m not sure how they fit together. Your title doesn''t help me much. However, I do get an overwhelming feeling that pi is important here; I just don''t know in what way. In other words, I find this image difficult to critique because I don''t know the rules it has created for itself. Does that make sense? Best of luck!</td>', 'When I see this image, I see circles, radii, and a storage disk. The lighting is fairly straightforward, not much mystery or anything, and the composition is almost symmetrical. And now I don''t know what to do with these pieces I just described. I''m not sure how they fit together. Your title doesn''t help me much. However, I do get an overwhelming feeling that pi is important here; I just don''t know in what way. In other words, I find this image difficult to critique because I don''t know the rules it has created for itself. Does that make sense? Best of luck!', '2003-04-11 01:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(262178, 16906, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever. The title really clues me in to start looking for pi in its various guises. The high contrast of this photo add an immediacy to it; so I''m puzzled by its use as this does not look like it needs immediacy. The lighting is marvelous and creates a sense of scientific mystery. Nice composition and cropping and a super idea.</td>', 'Clever. The title really clues me in to start looking for pi in its various guises. The high contrast of this photo add an immediacy to it; so I''m puzzled by its use as this does not look like it needs immediacy. The lighting is marvelous and creates a sense of scientific mystery. Nice composition and cropping and a super idea.', '2003-04-11 01:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262182, 17587, 6870, '<td valign="top">The circles of varying degrees of focus lend a sense of mystery to this photo, challenging us to think beyond the photograph to the essence of pi. In this regard, the title doesn''t help much. But the tones and colors help and slightly off center cropping is a nice touch.</td>', 'The circles of varying degrees of focus lend a sense of mystery to this photo, challenging us to think beyond the photograph to the essence of pi. In this regard, the title doesn''t help much. But the tones and colors help and slightly off center cropping is a nice touch.', '2003-04-11 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(262188, 17397, 6870, '<td valign="top">My ancestors came from Exeter, which is, I believe, just south of Stonehenge. I like this photo because this site uses pi in at least two ways: we all know that it is circular, and successfully demonstrate pi in a few of the rock formations. I like the high contrast, which enhance the pi sillouettes, and the clouds above are a wonderful source of mood.</td>', 'My ancestors came from Exeter, which is, I believe, just south of Stonehenge. I like this photo because this site uses pi in at least two ways: we all know that it is circular, and successfully demonstrate pi in a few of the rock formations. I like the high contrast, which enhance the pi sillouettes, and the clouds above are a wonderful source of mood.', '2003-04-11 02:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(262192, 17475, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work here. I love the instruments, all geared up to something with pi. Well composed and cropped, too. The colors don''t seem as sharp as they should be: there appears to be a yellowish cast to the image as a whole, but I really enjoy how this image celebrates pi.</td>', 'Nice work here. I love the instruments, all geared up to something with pi. Well composed and cropped, too. The colors don''t seem as sharp as they should be: there appears to be a yellowish cast to the image as a whole, but I really enjoy how this image celebrates pi.', '2003-04-11 02:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(262309, 17539, 7848, '<td valign="top">If I stand correct this is 3.1415926535_9_ but hey, close enough. But what a idea!</td>', 'If I stand correct this is 3.1415926535_9_ but hey, close enough. But what a idea!', '2003-04-11 04:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(262354, 17287, 3306, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the week. Really neat picture. Should win. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the week. Really neat picture. Should win. 10', '2003-04-11 08:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(262355, 17483, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect. I''ve seen this technique several times on DP and always like it. Yours is excellent. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Very interesting effect. I''ve seen this technique several times on DP and always like it. Yours is excellent. One of my favorites this week.', '2003-04-11 08:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(262356, 17295, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like everything about your picture. The placement, color, subject, tone, mood, focus are all excellent. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'I like everything about your picture. The placement, color, subject, tone, mood, focus are all excellent. One of my favorites this week.', '2003-04-11 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262357, 17569, 6202, '<td valign="top">nice play on words, and the pie looks very tempting too.</td>', 'nice play on words, and the pie looks very tempting too.', '2003-04-11 08:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(262464, 17312, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I''m not sure what it has to do specifically with pi, but I think its a pretty good pic.  Unique and creative.  Looks like a good wallpaper pattern.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I''m not sure what it has to do specifically with pi, but I think its a pretty good pic.  Unique and creative.  Looks like a good wallpaper pattern.', '2003-04-11 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(262545, 17539, 6870, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a 7, but I''m bumping it up to a 9, because I keep looking at it. I think it''s clever and demonstrates pi very well. Not only that, I like its whimsy, and the lighting and composition are marvelous. Nice work! Hey too bad they''re not pecans. We could have had pecan pi!</td>', 'I originally gave this a 7, but I''m bumping it up to a 9, because I keep looking at it. I think it''s clever and demonstrates pi very well. Not only that, I like its whimsy, and the lighting and composition are marvelous. Nice work! Hey too bad they''re not pecans. We could have had pecan pi!', '2003-04-11 13:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(262548, 17295, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''ll figure out the third one soon... Anyway, I like this photo. The lines on the mill stone let me know that you are communicating radii here, and the bench is a nice touch. I can see pi at work here. Nice tones and focus, too.</td>', 'I''m sure I''ll figure out the third one soon... Anyway, I like this photo. The lines on the mill stone let me know that you are communicating radii here, and the bench is a nice touch. I can see pi at work here. Nice tones and focus, too.', '2003-04-11 13:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(262550, 17347, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very clever. I was  hoping to come up with such an idea that was both mathematical and fun--and good photography. the two circles work wonders here, and it was a stroke of genius to fill only the circle and leave a void elsewhere. Nice work!</td>', 'This is very clever. I was  hoping to come up with such an idea that was both mathematical and fun--and good photography. the two circles work wonders here, and it was a stroke of genius to fill only the circle and leave a void elsewhere. Nice work!', '2003-04-11 13:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262556, 17147, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. With the watch, your image communicates to me a connection between time and pi, though I''m not sure what that connection is at this point, except that pi is on the watch.</td>', 'Fun idea. With the watch, your image communicates to me a connection between time and pi, though I''m not sure what that connection is at this point, except that pi is on the watch.', '2003-04-11 13:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262560, 17491, 4430, '<td valign="top">Good shot, like the motion feel to this, and the dof.  Meets challenge as well.</td>', 'Good shot, like the motion feel to this, and the dof.  Meets challenge as well.', '2003-04-11 13:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(262561, 17203, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice point of view here. By using the dial as a circle, I do get a feeling that pi (and math in general) can be found all around us, even in every day objects like this. To that end, I like the color, though I don''t know why, and your composition and cropping is excellent. Nice work.</td>', 'Really nice point of view here. By using the dial as a circle, I do get a feeling that pi (and math in general) can be found all around us, even in every day objects like this. To that end, I like the color, though I don''t know why, and your composition and cropping is excellent. Nice work.', '2003-04-11 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(262562, 17413, 4430, '<td valign="top">A nice representation of pi in the practical world.  Nice colors as well.</td>', 'A nice representation of pi in the practical world.  Nice colors as well.', '2003-04-11 13:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(262564, 17287, 4430, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I don''t normally like close-ups of eyes, but this is cool.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I don''t normally like close-ups of eyes, but this is cool.', '2003-04-11 13:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(262566, 17110, 4430, '<td valign="top">The only pie shot that is decent.  Nice set up and the addition of the pie server makes this a little more interesting to look at.  I like the red background as well.</td>', 'The only pie shot that is decent.  Nice set up and the addition of the pie server makes this a little more interesting to look at.  I like the red background as well.', '2003-04-11 13:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(262567, 16917, 4430, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are interesting, but I like them.  Pi and pie, very good.</td>', 'The colors in this are interesting, but I like them.  Pi and pie, very good.', '2003-04-11 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(262569, 17382, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I''m not exactly sure what you did with the colors here, but it works.  Like the placement of the pineapple and your border is nice as well.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I''m not exactly sure what you did with the colors here, but it works.  Like the placement of the pineapple and your border is nice as well.', '2003-04-11 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(262570, 17595, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good eye for pi! (hey that rhymes...). I see pi represented by the rails, and to this end this photo does what it sets out to do: show us the pi symbol. I wish it would take me further, though. Perhaps through lighting or different point of view you could take the next leap and show me that we can''t escape pi or that some mysterious thing about pi makes it pervasive around us. But I''m going a weird direction. Sorry. I like this shot, especially the tones and grainy nature of it.</td>', 'Good eye for pi! (hey that rhymes...). I see pi represented by the rails, and to this end this photo does what it sets out to do: show us the pi symbol. I wish it would take me further, though. Perhaps through lighting or different point of view you could take the next leap and show me that we can''t escape pi or that some mysterious thing about pi makes it pervasive around us. But I''m going a weird direction. Sorry. I like this shot, especially the tones and grainy nature of it.', '2003-04-11 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(262571, 17397, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like the color of the sky.  When I saw the thumbnail thought maybe too dark.  Seeing the larger version I like how dark it is, It gives it a creepy, mysterious feel.  10</td>', 'I really like the color of the sky.  When I saw the thumbnail thought maybe too dark.  Seeing the larger version I like how dark it is, It gives it a creepy, mysterious feel.  10', '2003-04-11 13:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(262572, 17483, 4430, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful use of this technique.  I like that you chose b/w as well.  An exellent photo. 10</td>', 'this is a wonderful use of this technique.  I like that you chose b/w as well.  An exellent photo. 10', '2003-04-11 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(262573, 17308, 4430, '<td valign="top">Great dof, great colors, I''m just not sure if i like the reflection of the ball on the board. 9</td>', 'Great dof, great colors, I''m just not sure if i like the reflection of the ball on the board. 9', '2003-04-11 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(262574, 17427, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like how clear and crisp the metal looks in this. I also like the choice of b/w. 9</td>', 'I really like how clear and crisp the metal looks in this. I also like the choice of b/w. 9', '2003-04-11 13:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(262575, 17490, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful pic and represents the challenge well, I also like the choice of b/w for this.  This is a very interesting shot. 9</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful pic and represents the challenge well, I also like the choice of b/w for this.  This is a very interesting shot. 9', '2003-04-11 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(262577, 17492, 6870, '<td valign="top">I wish it were a bit sharper, but I think that pi is very present here. You found an excellent object to communicate pi and extend even further into other geometry.</td>', 'I wish it were a bit sharper, but I think that pi is very present here. You found an excellent object to communicate pi and extend even further into other geometry.', '2003-04-11 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(262578, 17347, 4430, '<td valign="top">I like the old fasioned feel to this.  The lighting is great and definitly meets challenge.9</td>', 'I like the old fasioned feel to this.  The lighting is great and definitly meets challenge.9', '2003-04-11 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(262581, 17200, 4430, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of pi, but just needs something, or actually needs less of something.  The light on the left is distracting, and this just seems very unbalanced.  I really like the subject matter but I really can''t seem to find a real focal point.</td>', 'This is a good example of pi, but just needs something, or actually needs less of something.  The light on the left is distracting, and this just seems very unbalanced.  I really like the subject matter but I really can''t seem to find a real focal point.', '2003-04-11 13:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
