(262593, 17419, 4430, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid to comment too much on this because I''m afraid that this was just taken with a cheap camera and that the problems with it are related to that.  ie. grainy, not sharp etc...So the only prob I see not related  to camera is that it was cropped too close to the bottom, not really even.</td>', 'I''m afraid to comment too much on this because I''m afraid that this was just taken with a cheap camera and that the problems with it are related to that.  ie. grainy, not sharp etc...So the only prob I see not related  to camera is that it was cropped too close to the bottom, not really even.', '2003-04-11 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
