(262748, 17194, 6328, '<td valign="top">She is cute.  nice freckles too.  lovely eyes. nice little smile.</td>', 'She is cute.  nice freckles too.  lovely eyes. nice little smile.', '2003-04-11 16:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(262757, 16917, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging and clever shot. I think the split background enhances the interest here.</td>', 'Engaging and clever shot. I think the split background enhances the interest here.', '2003-04-11 16:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262761, 17562, 6870, '<td valign="top">A fun, graphic macro shot. I''m a little confused as to how, exactly this meets the pi challenge: if it is the roundness of the bike tire (pi deals with making circles as you know), it might be better to show us it circularity. The shocks and machinery of the bike also communicate pi in a subtle way: they kind of make up the symbol of pi. your sharpest focus is on the mud; I''m not sure if that is the most significant place to look. A lot of drama in this photo!</td>', 'A fun, graphic macro shot. I''m a little confused as to how, exactly this meets the pi challenge: if it is the roundness of the bike tire (pi deals with making circles as you know), it might be better to show us it circularity. The shocks and machinery of the bike also communicate pi in a subtle way: they kind of make up the symbol of pi. your sharpest focus is on the mud; I''m not sure if that is the most significant place to look. A lot of drama in this photo!', '2003-04-11 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(262762, 17528, 6870, '<td valign="top">Colorful and engaging, this is almost like a celebration of pi''s birthday! I wish the whole thing were in focus, though. i like the detail of the paper: nice touch.</td>', 'Colorful and engaging, this is almost like a celebration of pi''s birthday! I wish the whole thing were in focus, though. i like the detail of the paper: nice touch.', '2003-04-11 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(262767, 17092, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever and fun. I like the play on words. With this low point of view, you are still able to communicate the squarness of the pie. I kind of wish it were all in focus, though, or that the DOF could be even more out of focus, except for one spot.</td>', 'Clever and fun. I like the play on words. With this low point of view, you are still able to communicate the squarness of the pie. I kind of wish it were all in focus, though, or that the DOF could be even more out of focus, except for one spot.', '2003-04-11 16:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(262769, 17420, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting artwork, and the tire serves as a good example for the equation. More interesting lighting would really make this image stand out; it is quite unusual and engaging.</td>', 'Very interesting artwork, and the tire serves as a good example for the equation. More interesting lighting would really make this image stand out; it is quite unusual and engaging.', '2003-04-11 17:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(263028, 17203, 7863, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2003-04-12 00:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(263073, 17382, 6870, '<td valign="top">Surreal and interesting. I think the shadow adds to this shot by adding even further depth. Clever take on the challenge; a visual pun.</td>', 'Surreal and interesting. I think the shadow adds to this shot by adding even further depth. Clever take on the challenge; a visual pun.', '2003-04-12 04:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(263074, 17312, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really intriguing. Pi certainly has to do with circles, though I wish there was a clearer or perhaps more overt connection or dissection. Difficult to communicate: though pi has everything to do with circles, circles don''t necessarily mean pi and something telling me that these circles were communicating strictly pi would help this image meet the challenge better. Still, I like it and give it good marks.</td>', 'Really intriguing. Pi certainly has to do with circles, though I wish there was a clearer or perhaps more overt connection or dissection. Difficult to communicate: though pi has everything to do with circles, circles don''t necessarily mean pi and something telling me that these circles were communicating strictly pi would help this image meet the challenge better. Still, I like it and give it good marks.', '2003-04-12 04:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263075, 17592, 6870, '<td valign="top">A very scientific pizza! Fun idea and a clever visual pun, and that''s where it goes for me. Seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'A very scientific pizza! Fun idea and a clever visual pun, and that''s where it goes for me. Seems slightly out of focus.', '2003-04-12 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(263076, 17551, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well composed and I like the focus. Clever idea, too. I do wish, however that this went further than just giving us the word "pi." Perhaps through the words on the board other essences of pi could also be communicated?</td>', 'Well composed and I like the focus. Clever idea, too. I do wish, however that this went further than just giving us the word "pi." Perhaps through the words on the board other essences of pi could also be communicated?', '2003-04-12 04:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(263077, 17540, 6870, '<td valign="top">Whew! Almost did a very similar image! I don''t know if you meant this, but the apples being round enhance the "pi-ness" of the image. Nice lighting and focus, too.</td>', 'Whew! Almost did a very similar image! I don''t know if you meant this, but the apples being round enhance the "pi-ness" of the image. Nice lighting and focus, too.', '2003-04-12 04:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(263078, 17505, 6870, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing image with the earthy colors. You not only give me a hint of pi, you also show us an interesting object. It''s a tad out of focus, or perhaps just needs a greater DOF. My main question is: Pi makes circles, but do circles necessarily mean pi?</td>', 'A very pleasing image with the earthy colors. You not only give me a hint of pi, you also show us an interesting object. It''s a tad out of focus, or perhaps just needs a greater DOF. My main question is: Pi makes circles, but do circles necessarily mean pi?', '2003-04-12 04:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(263080, 17290, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo. I''ve looked at it long and hard now. I can see pi represented in the candles'' circles, and it is also in your title, but the connection isn''t quite convincing to me. However, being a religious man, I like to think that we can find God everywhere, even in pi. Even if I wasn''t a religious man, I think this is still an interesting communication.</td>', 'Fascinating photo. I''ve looked at it long and hard now. I can see pi represented in the candles'' circles, and it is also in your title, but the connection isn''t quite convincing to me. However, being a religious man, I like to think that we can find God everywhere, even in pi. Even if I wasn''t a religious man, I think this is still an interesting communication.', '2003-04-12 04:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(263081, 17548, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and arrangement of the disks. The background is interesting, too. My main question is this: Certainly pi helps to make circles, but do circles in and of themselves mean pi? The radial reflections help, but I''m still just a tad unconvinced. Still, very engaging and pleasing image.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and arrangement of the disks. The background is interesting, too. My main question is this: Certainly pi helps to make circles, but do circles in and of themselves mean pi? The radial reflections help, but I''m still just a tad unconvinced. Still, very engaging and pleasing image.', '2003-04-12 04:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(263082, 17225, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pi on pie. An interesting visual pun at work here. The pie looks delicious, but I''m still wanting more of a communication of pi than just its symbol on a dessert. I''d like something here to let me in pi''s secrets or uses. Knowwhatimean?</td>', 'Pi on pie. An interesting visual pun at work here. The pie looks delicious, but I''m still wanting more of a communication of pi than just its symbol on a dessert. I''d like something here to let me in pi''s secrets or uses. Knowwhatimean?', '2003-04-12 04:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(263083, 16967, 6870, '<td valign="top">After all these pies, this looks like a real treat! A clever punny image. It is probably just  a tad out of focus and a little washed.</td>', 'After all these pies, this looks like a real treat! A clever punny image. It is probably just  a tad out of focus and a little washed.', '2003-04-12 04:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(263084, 17229, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting and fascinating image. It''s as if the pi cutter measures pi much as pi measures a circle. Well, maybe anyway. It could probably be clearer if that''s your goal. If not, It is an interesting and fascinating image.</td>', 'Interesting and fascinating image. It''s as if the pi cutter measures pi much as pi measures a circle. Well, maybe anyway. It could probably be clearer if that''s your goal. If not, It is an interesting and fascinating image.', '2003-04-12 04:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(263086, 17569, 6870, '<td valign="top">A square pie: fun and clever. I really think the round plate behind adds to this image a lot by referring to pi''s function in circle building. It seems just a little out of focus.</td>', 'A square pie: fun and clever. I really think the round plate behind adds to this image a lot by referring to pi''s function in circle building. It seems just a little out of focus.', '2003-04-12 04:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(263087, 17413, 6870, '<td valign="top">F. Buckminster Fuller would be proud, and I''m sure he used pi in inventing these structures! This image seems a bit blury, perhaps a motion blur? I do like how it communicates pi by showing us lots of geometry.</td>', 'F. Buckminster Fuller would be proud, and I''m sure he used pi in inventing these structures! This image seems a bit blury, perhaps a motion blur? I do like how it communicates pi by showing us lots of geometry.', '2003-04-12 04:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(263216, 17505, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t seem to work. I like the fact that it''s pottery, and I can only imagine what shape the rest of the vessel is (I appreciate having to use my imagination), but the off centre composition doesn''t seem to have any good reason other than that it''s considered "wrong" to centre a photo, and the image overall lacks flair.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t seem to work. I like the fact that it''s pottery, and I can only imagine what shape the rest of the vessel is (I appreciate having to use my imagination), but the off centre composition doesn''t seem to have any good reason other than that it''s considered "wrong" to centre a photo, and the image overall lacks flair.', '2003-04-12 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(263222, 17378, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the lighting, the subtle tones of the sand and water, and the textures. The composition is really nice, the way the line of the number leads up to the arc of water.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the lighting, the subtle tones of the sand and water, and the textures. The composition is really nice, the way the line of the number leads up to the arc of water.', '2003-04-12 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(263225, 17283, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I like the high contrast, the textures and the bold composition.</td>', 'Very dramatic. I like the high contrast, the textures and the bold composition.', '2003-04-12 12:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(263233, 17225, 1037, '<td valign="top">Colourful photo, but it seems very over the top to me. Too busy and gaudy to have a nice visual impact.</td>', 'Colourful photo, but it seems very over the top to me. Too busy and gaudy to have a nice visual impact.', '2003-04-12 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(263236, 17587, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting in an abstract way. I''m not sure what I''m looking at. The composition is pleasant, but something about the colours feels weird to me. Earthy and metallic. I don''t quite like it, overall.</td>', 'Interesting in an abstract way. I''m not sure what I''m looking at. The composition is pleasant, but something about the colours feels weird to me. Earthy and metallic. I don''t quite like it, overall.', '2003-04-12 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(263241, 17387, 1037, '<td valign="top">Stunning textures and nice composition. The sky has just enough cloud to avoid being boring, but I still think a slightly tighter crop would be an improvement. Is it one of those Japanese sun gates, or just an old piece of a ruined building?</td>', 'Stunning textures and nice composition. The sky has just enough cloud to avoid being boring, but I still think a slightly tighter crop would be an improvement. Is it one of those Japanese sun gates, or just an old piece of a ruined building?', '2003-04-12 12:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(263246, 17310, 1037, '<td valign="top">The ideas in this are a bit mixed... the title takes it over the top. Lots of very geeky jokes! It''s well composed and lit. The border isn''t very attractive to me.</td>', 'The ideas in this are a bit mixed... the title takes it over the top. Lots of very geeky jokes! It''s well composed and lit. The border isn''t very attractive to me.', '2003-04-12 12:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(263250, 16783, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful. 10 from me!', '2003-04-12 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(263255, 17396, 1037, '<td valign="top">The photo is good on addressing the subject matter, but not very attractive. There is too much in it, and the arrangement of objects is very loose. The lines and curves could have been arranged with more attention to leading lines, etc.</td>', 'The photo is good on addressing the subject matter, but not very attractive. There is too much in it, and the arrangement of objects is very loose. The lines and curves could have been arranged with more attention to leading lines, etc.', '2003-04-12 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(263265, 17503, 1037, '<td valign="top">Not a very attractive photo. The combination of colours here alone is nasty. Black, yellow and brown!! The composition and lighting need a lot of work, and the border is too wide, without anything to separate it from the rest of the image (eg. a thin white border on the inside).</td>', 'Not a very attractive photo. The combination of colours here alone is nasty. Black, yellow and brown!! The composition and lighting need a lot of work, and the border is too wide, without anything to separate it from the rest of the image (eg. a thin white border on the inside).', '2003-04-12 12:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(263270, 17288, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. Are the round parts of the objects the subject here? The photo is cluttered, the composition is very flat, and the lighting is harsh. Try to stick with one subject and take a closer shot, with diffused light (put some tissue paper or similar over the light).</td>', 'I don''t get it. Are the round parts of the objects the subject here? The photo is cluttered, the composition is very flat, and the lighting is harsh. Try to stick with one subject and take a closer shot, with diffused light (put some tissue paper or similar over the light).', '2003-04-12 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(263273, 17548, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colours in the CDs are gorgeous, but it would have been better if you''d played with framing one CD rather than this grouping. The background isn''t very complementary... the colour is dull, and it has visible ripples.</td>', 'The colours in the CDs are gorgeous, but it would have been better if you''d played with framing one CD rather than this grouping. The background isn''t very complementary... the colour is dull, and it has visible ripples.', '2003-04-12 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(263285, 17489, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a strange idea... the shape of the pi is a bit sloppy, the lighting is too harsh from below, and it''s overexposed in places. The colours are very gaudy.</td>', 'This is a strange idea... the shape of the pi is a bit sloppy, the lighting is too harsh from below, and it''s overexposed in places. The colours are very gaudy.', '2003-04-12 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(263290, 17092, 1037, '<td valign="top">That looks so unappetising! Didn''t you get fluff all through the pie?<br/> <br/>A strange visual pun. It''s not highly attractive as a photo. I like the camera angle and the lighting, but the subject matter is just corny.</td>', 'That looks so unappetising! Didn''t you get fluff all through the pie? A strange visual pun. It''s not highly attractive as a photo. I like the camera angle and the lighting, but the subject matter is just corny.', '2003-04-12 13:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(263295, 17256, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love it :). It''s a gorgeous photo aesthetically, and appeals to my geeky side. The shallow depth of field is very attractive.</td>', 'I love it :). It''s a gorgeous photo aesthetically, and appeals to my geeky side. The shallow depth of field is very attractive.', '2003-04-12 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263299, 17569, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this very attractive. The composition is flat and static, with a centred square. It would be better with a lower angle and shallow DOF to add depth and pull the eyes to a stronger focal point. Parts of the photo are overexposed.</td>', 'I don''t find this very attractive. The composition is flat and static, with a centred square. It would be better with a lower angle and shallow DOF to add depth and pull the eyes to a stronger focal point. Parts of the photo are overexposed.', '2003-04-12 13:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(263305, 17051, 1037, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of photos like this one, that tried to address the subject in a humourous way, but don''t succeed as an artwork. The aesthetics of a photo like this are weak. It''s centred, static, geometric, and the glistening cheese fat makes me feel ill.</td>', 'There are a lot of photos like this one, that tried to address the subject in a humourous way, but don''t succeed as an artwork. The aesthetics of a photo like this are weak. It''s centred, static, geometric, and the glistening cheese fat makes me feel ill.', '2003-04-12 13:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(263311, 17194, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s true, she is cute! And it''s a very lovely black and white portrait, with beautiful lighting and great composition. Her expression is completely natural. It''s a BIG stretch to say this fits the challenge though!! I''ll subtract one point for that (I''m not harsh on that kind of thing).</td>', 'It''s true, she is cute! And it''s a very lovely black and white portrait, with beautiful lighting and great composition. Her expression is completely natural. It''s a BIG stretch to say this fits the challenge though!! I''ll subtract one point for that (I''m not harsh on that kind of thing).', '2003-04-12 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263316, 17540, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice apples....I like the lighting on them in particular. I''m not sure that this would be an appealing photo out of the context of the challenge though. The border is strange.</td>', 'Nice apples....I like the lighting on them in particular. I''m not sure that this would be an appealing photo out of the context of the challenge though. The border is strange.', '2003-04-12 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263323, 17118, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but doesn''t fit the challenge in any way that I can see!</td>', 'Cute shot, but doesn''t fit the challenge in any way that I can see!', '2003-04-12 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(263331, 17406, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, DOF and black and white (although I see a touch of sepia or gold in there).</td>', 'Lovely composition, DOF and black and white (although I see a touch of sepia or gold in there).', '2003-04-12 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(263339, 17312, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can''t work out whether or not I like this background. It does set off the water drops nicely, but the texture is distracting. The composition of this is nice for an abstract photo - just varied enough to bring your eyes down to that large drop on the bottom right, but still with a sense of disorder. Interesting idea.</td>', 'I can''t work out whether or not I like this background. It does set off the water drops nicely, but the texture is distracting. The composition of this is nice for an abstract photo - just varied enough to bring your eyes down to that large drop on the bottom right, but still with a sense of disorder. Interesting idea.', '2003-04-12 13:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(263346, 17539, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I like the lighting on this, and the background is nice. The subject matter isn''t highly aesthetically pleasing, though.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I like the lighting on this, and the background is nice. The subject matter isn''t highly aesthetically pleasing, though.', '2003-04-12 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(263348, 17504, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this, although the subject matter is kind of strange. The pebbles are a nice background.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this, although the subject matter is kind of strange. The pebbles are a nice background.', '2003-04-12 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(263356, 17483, 4517, '<td valign="top">Done many times before but it`s one of the best ones.</td>', 'Done many times before but it`s one of the best ones.', '2003-04-12 13:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(263391, 17052, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting catch. You could have brought the colours up with some processing. Try manipulating the levels in photoshop or a similar program, or at least just increasing the contrast.<br/> <br/>Here''s what I got with a little bit of playing around: //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/pisky2.jpg. It''s grainy, but the colours are stronger.</td>', 'Interesting catch. You could have brought the colours up with some processing. Try manipulating the levels in photoshop or a similar program, or at least just increasing the contrast. Here''s what I got with a little bit of playing around: //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/pisky2.jpg. It''s grainy, but the colours are stronger.', '2003-04-12 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263402, 17497, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I''ve commented on a lot of photos that they meet the subject matter, but have made little attempt at creating a work of art. This photo is a great example to all of them. Absolutely stunning. 10!</td>', 'Beautiful. I''ve commented on a lot of photos that they meet the subject matter, but have made little attempt at creating a work of art. This photo is a great example to all of them. Absolutely stunning. 10!', '2003-04-12 13:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(263414, 17595, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the grainy look to this photo. The composition is weird and cool. Nice work, in my opinion!</td>', 'I really like the grainy look to this photo. The composition is weird and cool. Nice work, in my opinion!', '2003-04-12 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263419, 17420, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cute. I''ve looked at this for a little while trying to work out how I feel about it, and overall I have to say I like it! Somehow it works, despite being a mixed shot with a few different ideas going on, and the composition is linear and central. Not an amazing work of art, but nice in its own way.</td>', 'This is cute. I''ve looked at this for a little while trying to work out how I feel about it, and overall I have to say I like it! Somehow it works, despite being a mixed shot with a few different ideas going on, and the composition is linear and central. Not an amazing work of art, but nice in its own way.', '2003-04-12 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(263424, 17225, 4517, '<td valign="top">The trouble with that spray cream is it goes flat very quickly. Very well lit and nice background.</td>', 'The trouble with that spray cream is it goes flat very quickly. Very well lit and nice background.', '2003-04-12 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(263426, 17374, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I love the odd sense of scale and perspective. That object is so beautiful. The only thing I don''t like is the brown border. I don''t really like it when people use a colour from the image for the border... it distracts me from the subject with that colour, and kind of undermines its influence in the photo.</td>', 'This is really cool. I love the odd sense of scale and perspective. That object is so beautiful. The only thing I don''t like is the brown border. I don''t really like it when people use a colour from the image for the border... it distracts me from the subject with that colour, and kind of undermines its influence in the photo.', '2003-04-12 14:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(263427, 17494, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very good but unluckly for you the other one is better.</td>', 'Very good but unluckly for you the other one is better.', '2003-04-12 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(263428, 17427, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white. The composition is a bit too formal for me... everything so well aligned. It suits the subject matter, but it''s dull.</td>', 'Nice black and white. The composition is a bit too formal for me... everything so well aligned. It suits the subject matter, but it''s dull.', '2003-04-12 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(263431, 17191, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but the photo is a bit dull. The subject matter is meaningful but not aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Cool idea, but the photo is a bit dull. The subject matter is meaningful but not aesthetically pleasing.', '2003-04-12 14:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(263434, 17595, 4517, '<td valign="top">Well spotted pi shape, but how grainy is that.</td>', 'Well spotted pi shape, but how grainy is that.', '2003-04-12 14:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(263440, 17418, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the shapes, textures and colours in this photo. Very subtle.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the shapes, textures and colours in this photo. Very subtle.', '2003-04-12 14:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(263441, 17118, 4517, '<td valign="top">Without the title you couldn`t say this was a pi photo challenge.</td>', 'Without the title you couldn`t say this was a pi photo challenge.', '2003-04-12 14:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(263467, 17287, 7073, '<td valign="top">Very VERY awesome shot!  I like it a lot!</td>', 'Very VERY awesome shot!  I like it a lot!', '2003-04-12 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(263468, 17312, 7073, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand what this has to do with Pi, but it is a really cool shot!</td>', 'I don''t really understand what this has to do with Pi, but it is a really cool shot!', '2003-04-12 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(263488, 17374, 7523, '<td valign="top">What an amazing picture! I love the etheral look of the weird thing in the sky and one lone arm holding it up. If I could vote, I''d give it a 9!</td>', 'What an amazing picture! I love the etheral look of the weird thing in the sky and one lone arm holding it up. If I could vote, I''d give it a 9!', '2003-04-12 15:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(263542, 17052, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Would be nice if the picture were a bit clearer, the colors a bit lighter, maybe?</td>', 'Good idea.  Would be nice if the picture were a bit clearer, the colors a bit lighter, maybe?', '2003-04-12 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(263543, 17118, 5112, '<td valign="top">Looks more like she''s eating a cookie!</td>', 'Looks more like she''s eating a cookie!', '2003-04-12 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(263544, 17551, 5112, '<td valign="top">You should have gotten that "P" on the Triple Letter Score!  Nice picture.</td>', 'You should have gotten that "P" on the Triple Letter Score!  Nice picture.', '2003-04-12 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(263545, 16783, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-04-12 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(263547, 17494, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the "panoramic" aspect to this picture.  I like how clear it is.</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the "panoramic" aspect to this picture.  I like how clear it is.', '2003-04-12 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(263548, 17194, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like it that her (or is it his?) eyes are clear.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like it that her (or is it his?) eyes are clear.', '2003-04-12 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(263549, 17539, 5112, '<td valign="top">Are you sure it''s 3.1415.... ?</td>', 'Are you sure it''s 3.1415.... ?', '2003-04-12 18:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
