(263681, 17264, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good idea well-executed. The only thing I''d have done differently is to have the numbers "run around" the Pi-figure cutout, instead of obliterating some of the numbers. But I have access to software that would make that easier...<br/>Technically though, I think Pi is an irrational, but not a transcendental number...</td>', 'Good idea well-executed. The only thing I''d have done differently is to have the numbers "run around" the Pi-figure cutout, instead of obliterating some of the numbers. But I have access to software that would make that easier...Technically though, I think Pi is an irrational, but not a transcendental number...', '2003-04-12 21:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
