(263978, 17562, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I see the pi! The shallow DOF is nice, and so is the texture of the muddy bike tyre. Nice rakish angle to make the composition interesting.</td>', 'Cool idea. I see the pi! The shallow DOF is nice, and so is the texture of the muddy bike tyre. Nice rakish angle to make the composition interesting.', '2003-04-13 11:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
