(263993, 17592, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but the colours and textures in this are just revolting!! Especially on a brown background. The composition is OK.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but the colours and textures in this are just revolting!! Especially on a brown background. The composition is OK.', '2003-04-13 11:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
