(263996, 17492, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s really cool and elaborate! Love the colours. I think this is one photo where plain, centred composition works because of the amount of detail in the quilting. Nice work.</td>', 'That''s really cool and elaborate! Love the colours. I think this is one photo where plain, centred composition works because of the amount of detail in the quilting. Nice work.', '2003-04-13 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(263997, 17518, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the way it creates an optical illusion... like you''re looking at a bird cage. I like the overall colours and tones. The lighting is great.</td>', 'Nice. I like the way it creates an optical illusion... like you''re looking at a bird cage. I like the overall colours and tones. The lighting is great.', '2003-04-13 11:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(263999, 17382, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting visual pun, but not aesthetically pleasing. The combination of green and yellow is very garish. The shadow and off-centre composition work well together, but the lighting on the pineapple is too bright.</td>', 'Interesting visual pun, but not aesthetically pleasing. The combination of green and yellow is very garish. The shadow and off-centre composition work well together, but the lighting on the pineapple is too bright.', '2003-04-13 12:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(264000, 17199, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lots of information in the photo, but its composition is loose and the red background is overwhelming..</td>', 'Lots of information in the photo, but its composition is loose and the red background is overwhelming..', '2003-04-13 12:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(264002, 17475, 1037, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of elements packed into this tight crop. Maybe a simpler composition would have more impact.</td>', 'There are a lot of elements packed into this tight crop. Maybe a simpler composition would have more impact.', '2003-04-13 12:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(264007, 17110, 1037, '<td valign="top">A lot of these pie shots are taken from directily above, with a background that doesn''t really complement the photo. I find them dull and not aesthetically pleasing. It fits the challenge in a tangential way, but its artistic values just aren''t there.</td>', 'A lot of these pie shots are taken from directily above, with a background that doesn''t really complement the photo. I find them dull and not aesthetically pleasing. It fits the challenge in a tangential way, but its artistic values just aren''t there.', '2003-04-13 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264010, 17147, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Could do with a bit more tonal depth, by adjusting the levels or contrast on the image. The composition is OK.</td>', 'Cute idea. Could do with a bit more tonal depth, by adjusting the levels or contrast on the image. The composition is OK.', '2003-04-13 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(264011, 17290, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the reference in the title. Is it religious? The composition is very loose. It''s just a collection of objects, not very aesthetically arranged, and with a lot of empty space around them that doesn''t make any impact.</td>', 'I don''t understand the reference in the title. Is it religious? The composition is very loose. It''s just a collection of objects, not very aesthetically arranged, and with a lot of empty space around them that doesn''t make any impact.', '2003-04-13 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(264012, 17397, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I won''t be surprised if this wins, unless people judge it to be off-topic for some reason. I love the cloud textures and the colours. Great composition and perfect silhouette. 10 from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I won''t be surprised if this wins, unless people judge it to be off-topic for some reason. I love the cloud textures and the colours. Great composition and perfect silhouette. 10 from me.', '2003-04-13 12:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(264013, 17343, 1037, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those japanese sun gates. I like the composition of this, but I think it could do with some processing to bring out the tonal depth a bit more. It just feels a bit washed out.</td>', 'Looks like one of those japanese sun gates. I like the composition of this, but I think it could do with some processing to bring out the tonal depth a bit more. It just feels a bit washed out.', '2003-04-13 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(264032, 17490, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this... it''s a really cool idea. That calendar is nifty! The lighting seems a bit off to me though. The photo could also do with a bit more tonal depth.</td>', 'I like this... it''s a really cool idea. That calendar is nifty! The lighting seems a bit off to me though. The photo could also do with a bit more tonal depth.', '2003-04-13 12:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
