(264043, 17427, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice set up, well taken photo.  Greyscale is the way to go with this one.</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice set up, well taken photo.  Greyscale is the way to go with this one.', '2003-04-13 12:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(264045, 17491, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I enjoyed orienteering as a kid :). An obscure concept I''m sure a lot of people won''t understand. I like the shallow DOF. Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting. I enjoyed orienteering as a kid :). An obscure concept I''m sure a lot of people won''t understand. I like the shallow DOF. Nicely done.', '2003-04-13 12:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(264047, 17542, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...... not sure what to make of this one. Should you have tried to create the atmosphere of the film, as a homage? Or is it enough to just show some promotional stuff? I think the composition is OK, but the photo borrows too much from the design work done by the promotional team for the film. Not much creativity evident in arranging and photographing the poster and CD.</td>', 'Hmmmm...... not sure what to make of this one. Should you have tried to create the atmosphere of the film, as a homage? Or is it enough to just show some promotional stuff? I think the composition is OK, but the photo borrows too much from the design work done by the promotional team for the film. Not much creativity evident in arranging and photographing the poster and CD.', '2003-04-13 12:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(264049, 17200, 1037, '<td valign="top">Quite nice. I appreciate the circles and radial lines. The pi ratio is visually evident at every junction of straight line and curve. Nicely composed. It has an overexposed look, but I like that.</td>', 'Quite nice. I appreciate the circles and radial lines. The pi ratio is visually evident at every junction of straight line and curve. Nicely composed. It has an overexposed look, but I like that.', '2003-04-13 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(264050, 17512, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the shadow, but the background is very busy, and the idea of using knives is a bit strange.</td>', 'I like the use of the shadow, but the background is very busy, and the idea of using knives is a bit strange.', '2003-04-13 12:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(264051, 16780, 1037, '<td valign="top">I see it. This photo is interesting and original. I like the grainy look. I think it would work with a little more contrast (althoug the gamma on my monitor is high).</td>', 'I see it. This photo is interesting and original. I like the grainy look. I think it would work with a little more contrast (althoug the gamma on my monitor is high).', '2003-04-13 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(264052, 16917, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the high contrast look and vivid colours. Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the high contrast look and vivid colours. Nice work.', '2003-04-13 13:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(264054, 16842, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t qujte see the pi. It''s an interesting structrue though. The sky is overexposed, but that''s hard to avoid.</td>', 'I don''t qujte see the pi. It''s an interesting structrue though. The sky is overexposed, but that''s hard to avoid.', '2003-04-13 13:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(264055, 17295, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can see 2... what''s the third sign?<br/> <br/>The tonal depth of this is a bit low... ie, it seems washed out to me. the sky is very pale. The composition seems very static, except for that tree.</td>', 'I can see 2... what''s the third sign? The tonal depth of this is a bit low... ie, it seems washed out to me. the sky is very pale. The composition seems very static, except for that tree.', '2003-04-13 13:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(264056, 17308, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very tangential to the challenge. The chess board could suggest a form of measurement, but only if I use my imagination.... The colours are nice, and I like the shallow DOF, but this is a highly cliche photo (an egg and a chess board!) without a strong impact in its own right.</td>', 'This is very tangential to the challenge. The chess board could suggest a form of measurement, but only if I use my imagination.... The colours are nice, and I like the shallow DOF, but this is a highly cliche photo (an egg and a chess board!) without a strong impact in its own right.', '2003-04-13 13:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(264057, 17528, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colours and the high contrast in this. It''s better than a lot of similar photos in the challenge. The camera angle adds depth, and the white background keeps it clean and simple.<br/> <br/>Yet, it isn''t a highly artistic image. It still seems more like a photo that was designed to meet the challenge rather than be a work of art.</td>', 'I like the bright colours and the high contrast in this. It''s better than a lot of similar photos in the challenge. The camera angle adds depth, and the white background keeps it clean and simple. Yet, it isn''t a highly artistic image. It still seems more like a photo that was designed to meet the challenge rather than be a work of art.', '2003-04-13 13:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(264058, 17419, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is one of the less interesting pie shots. It''s washed out and grainy, and the pie itself isn''t highly visually appealing.</td>', 'This is one of the less interesting pie shots. It''s washed out and grainy, and the pie itself isn''t highly visually appealing.', '2003-04-13 13:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(264059, 17181, 1037, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the more interesting pie photos! The creative cropping sets it apart. I love the warm lighting too. The subtle pi symbol cut into the crust is a great touch.</td>', 'Definitely one of the more interesting pie photos! The creative cropping sets it apart. I love the warm lighting too. The subtle pi symbol cut into the crust is a great touch.', '2003-04-13 13:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(264060, 17070, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I''m not sure if all the negative space really works. I think it weakens the impact of the bananas rather than strengthening it. I love the colours in this though, and the lighting is great.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I''m not sure if all the negative space really works. I think it weakens the impact of the bananas rather than strengthening it. I love the colours in this though, and the lighting is great.', '2003-04-13 13:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264061, 17061, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very washed out. I can hardly see the ruler.</td>', 'Very washed out. I can hardly see the ruler.', '2003-04-13 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264063, 17347, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I''m not sure I understand what I''m looking at. I like the deep black and white tones, and the composition is effective.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I''m not sure I understand what I''m looking at. I like the deep black and white tones, and the composition is effective.', '2003-04-13 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(264068, 17203, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Great DOF, great composition, and really nice, rich colours. The textures are lovely too.</td>', 'I really like this photo. Great DOF, great composition, and really nice, rich colours. The textures are lovely too.', '2003-04-13 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(264069, 17171, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo, but it feels a bit too big and square. The tonal depth is a bit lacking too.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo, but it feels a bit too big and square. The tonal depth is a bit lacking too.', '2003-04-13 13:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
