(265857, 17569, 6855, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB<br/> <br/>Challenge:  Met the challenge, but the play on words may have turned some people off.<br/> <br/>Composition: As clever and creative as this shot it, it does come off a bit flat.  Did you use an on-camera flash for lighting?  The blue plate adds some nice contrast.<br/> <br/>Overall:  Very cute idea and a very refreshing change to the pi (pie) competition!</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB Challenge:  Met the challenge, but the play on words may have turned some people off. Composition: As clever and creative as this shot it, it does come off a bit flat.  Did you use an on-camera flash for lighting?  The blue plate adds some nice contrast. Overall:  Very cute idea and a very refreshing change to the pi (pie) competition!', '2003-04-14 15:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(266026, 17427, 4517, '<td valign="top">Well done, well deserved 2nd place.</td>', 'Well done, well deserved 2nd place.', '2003-04-14 17:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
