(266103, 17287, 3575, '<td valign="top">Well deserved win, Richard. I know I''m supposed to ignore the low scores but I would love to know why two people thought you should have a 1. Yours was my favorite this week and also the favorite of the math guys I work with. You photos always are the result of great care and expert execution. I look forward to seeing yours in the future.</td>', 'Well deserved win, Richard. I know I''m supposed to ignore the low scores but I would love to know why two people thought you should have a 1. Yours was my favorite this week and also the favorite of the math guys I work with. You photos always are the result of great care and expert execution. I look forward to seeing yours in the future.', '2003-04-14 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(266127, 17308, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC   Howdy DougPaz </b> <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge-Yes <br/>Composition-Lovely <br/>Background-Good..very good <br/>My Opinion-Tones and DOF make this shot for me. Really done well. Love the contast of the squares. The light is nice and works for me. Good job. Congrast on your new F717. It''s the hot camera. Not much to add here. Sorry Doug. I think it''s about as good as can be.<br/></td>', 'CC   Howdy DougPaz   Fits The Challenge-Yes Composition-Lovely Background-Good..very good My Opinion-Tones and DOF make this shot for me. Really done well. Love the contast of the squares. The light is nice and works for me. Good job. Congrast on your new F717. It''s the hot camera. Not much to add here. Sorry Doug. I think it''s about as good as can be.', '2003-04-14 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(266137, 17562, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC   Hello karmat </b> <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge-Yes-a stretch, but I get it. <br/>Composition-Good <br/>Background-Good-I like shallow dof. Good color.<br/>My Opinion-I think the texture, and the color make this shot. It''s interesting to look at and a feast for the eye. Not the usual. Unique.<br/>Well done. Not much to add either way, I think you did this just fine.<br/></td>', 'CC   Hello karmat   Fits The Challenge-Yes-a stretch, but I get it. Composition-Good Background-Good-I like shallow dof. Good color.My Opinion-I think the texture, and the color make this shot. It''s interesting to look at and a feast for the eye. Not the usual. Unique.Well done. Not much to add either way, I think you did this just fine.', '2003-04-14 18:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
