(266215, 17595, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC</b>   Hello kandyj <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge-Yes <br/>Composition-Good <br/>Background-Good <br/>My Opinion-I don''t really need to point out the gainy look of this shot. I''m sure you got that point, but I will say like several that I kind of like that here. It''s adding to the over all texture of the shot. I do think the shot is dark and needed to adjusted with levels. I am aware that most stairs aren''t lit well, indoors. Still you did a great job finding the symbol PI-! Amazing find!! Over all this is good, it''s good to look at. Yeah for you.<br/> <br/></td>', 'CC   Hello kandyj  Fits The Challenge-Yes Composition-Good Background-Good My Opinion-I don''t really need to point out the gainy look of this shot. I''m sure you got that point, but I will say like several that I kind of like that here. It''s adding to the over all texture of the shot. I do think the shot is dark and needed to adjusted with levels. I am aware that most stairs aren''t lit well, indoors. Still you did a great job finding the symbol PI-! Amazing find!! Over all this is good, it''s good to look at. Yeah for you. ', '2003-04-14 19:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(266228, 16906, 327, '<td valign="top"><b>CC   Hello mbardeen </b> <br/> <br/>Fits The Challenge-Yes <br/>Composition-Good <br/>Background-Good <br/>My Opinion-I''m glad you listed all four. I missed two of them DUH. This shot is very grainy/lots of noise. I also think the light could of been a bit more even. On the positive side...you did PI. It was not and easy subject to shoot. The colors or tones B&amp;W is perfect for this shot. You did well.</td>', 'CC   Hello mbardeen   Fits The Challenge-Yes Composition-Good Background-Good My Opinion-I''m glad you listed all four. I missed two of them DUH. This shot is very grainy/lots of noise. I also think the light could of been a bit more even. On the positive side...you did PI. It was not and easy subject to shoot. The colors or tones B&W is perfect for this shot. You did well.', '2003-04-14 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(266389, 17483, 7893, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, very nice effects but i am afraid that if u see the subject more scientificly you will discover that you can''t use the capital letter Ð from the greek alphabet to represent the minuscule ð, it is not mathematically correct. But as an art, yes it is great.<br/></td>', 'Very nice photo, very nice effects but i am afraid that if u see the subject more scientificly you will discover that you can''t use the capital letter Ð from the greek alphabet to represent the minuscule ð, it is not mathematically correct. But as an art, yes it is great.', '2003-04-14 21:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(266757, 17587, 4967, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>Hi Geocide - I really think the your color entry was much more effectual than this one, even though they were of the same items... <br/> <br/>Did you just crop substantially in on a similar photo to the other?  That''s how it looks to me because of the extreme graininess of the photo.  Thats hard to deal with sometimes, but it''s something to think about.  I think it fit the challenge pretty well... it definitely had the circle in there (which is awesome for pi) and I think it was an interesting shot with multi layers.  Lighting isn''t bad... and I like the DOF... The colors of the photo are kind of dull... but otherwise it''s not really bad, just not extremely appealing to me.  <br/> <br/>This is a very different photo... somewhat interesting but not my style.  We all have our own opinions.  Best of luck!<br/> <br/>-Talya</td>', 'Critique Club Hi Geocide - I really think the your color entry was much more effectual than this one, even though they were of the same items...  Did you just crop substantially in on a similar photo to the other?  That''s how it looks to me because of the extreme graininess of the photo.  Thats hard to deal with sometimes, but it''s something to think about.  I think it fit the challenge pretty well... it definitely had the circle in there (which is awesome for pi) and I think it was an interesting shot with multi layers.  Lighting isn''t bad... and I like the DOF... The colors of the photo are kind of dull... but otherwise it''s not really bad, just not extremely appealing to me.   This is a very different photo... somewhat interesting but not my style.  We all have our own opinions.  Best of luck! -Talya', '2003-04-15 00:46:55.000000', NULL, 0),
